{"id": "EUVD-2026-55359", "enisaUuid": "9151ade4-c119-3a82-9332-5a58cbb5c35e", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdkfd: Check bounds on CRIU restore queue type and mqd size\n\nWe weren't checking whether the values provided in the private\ndata in kfd CRIU restore were within bounds.\n\nFor queue type, add a KFD_QUEUE_TYPE_MAX and ensure the provided\ntype is less than it.\n\nFor mqd_size, add new function mqd_size_from_queue_type and confirm\nthat the provided mqd_size matches expectations.\n\n(cherry picked from commit f19d8086f6644083c913d70bfdeee20e1b6f46a5)", "datePublished": "2026-08-10T12:01:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:43:41", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b817c0dfc653bf33d0e0ab8155ff7807a617487", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1956aa246c65c5895589664ccb37d0710aa8d304", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fd1691ec62701c982ea32e749678988c67fd4c21", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cc10a5839756982504ee8568fc1e1625962ab7f8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47ea05f246bebc81c7796f56265cffd812cf0601"], "aliases": ["GHSA-vj59-w4c8-vwfg", "CVE-2026-68258"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "17065450-7a78-3869-abf0-a8cc78d19268", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.42"}, {"id": "38df1d9e-45b2-3a04-8ae4-dbde427e5d0b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "42c6c48214b726c30918e8dc80e2168607d13ae4 <fd1691ec62701c982ea32e749678988c67fd4c21"}, {"id": "7273449e-3f4e-3e3e-a9b2-9301c459d3b6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "42c6c48214b726c30918e8dc80e2168607d13ae4 <1956aa246c65c5895589664ccb37d0710aa8d304"}, {"id": "8f6dccb2-a766-3dca-a522-bb962ad29cfa", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "pr